@flexiarg operator/ask-what-other-known-defects-remain
@title Ask What Other Known Defects Remain
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-PwY969 turn-fZQsyL; first proposed for: One repair is under way and the operator wants the next item to be ready.
@why [operator/repairs-before-the-expensive-run]

! conclusion: List the defects already recorded (with where), say which are open, and mark anything not yet confirmed.

  + IF:
    He asks whether other known defects are left to work on.

  + HOWEVER:
    The agent may list suspicions as if they were known defects.

  + THEN:
    List the defects already recorded (with where), say which are open, and mark anything not yet confirmed.

  + BECAUSE:
    The operator is planning the order of repairs and needs the known set, not a guess.
